      "system__conversation_history": "{\"x-elevenlabs-history\": true, \"entries\": [{\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Hi, quick question, what are your office hours?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Recorded for quality and training purposes. Para espa\\u00f1ol, oprima el dos. Thanks for calling Pivot Point Orthopedics, part of Pretty Good AI. How may I help you today?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Hey there. Yeah, I just had a quick question about your office hours. Could you tell me what they are for weekdays?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"Sure. Divot Point Orthopedics is open Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday from 9:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m., Wednesday from 12:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m., and Friday from 9:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. Let me know if you need anything else.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Thanks for that. Are you guys open on weekends at all?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"We're closed on weekends. The clinic is open Monday through Friday only. If you need to schedule or ask about appointments, I can help with that.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Got it, thanks. Just one more thing, do you have any special hours during holidays?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"We follow regular hours most of the year, but the clinic may close or adjust hours for major holidays. If you have a specific holiday in mind, I can check for you. Would you like to ask about a certain date?\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"No, not really a specific holiday. I was just wondering generally if you guys close for things like Christmas or New Year's, or if it's just regular hours.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"We usually close for major holidays like Christmas and New Year's. For most other days, we keep regular hours. If you ever need to confirm for a specific holiday, just give us a call.\"}, {\"role\": \"agent\", \"message\": \"Alright, that makes sense. Thanks for the info. I think that's all I needed to know for now. Have a good one!\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"message\": \"You're welcome. If you need anything else, just call. Have a great day.\"}]}",
